{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1000_p", "source_sha256": "013d37c3f70e806446ab14cb37435e954c58aa3953d6b0f818ad8283fdaf79ab", "ja": "（このみさんがプロデュースした服が完成した。\n『試着が終わった』と連絡がきたので行ってみよう）", "zh": "（木实小姐设计的服装已经完成了。\n收到她发来的『试穿结束了』的消息，去看看吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1001_p", "source_sha256": "eda2308768aac22e90f564e92c632588ca8ce37372043a4ec4b5f02ba32c8b03", "ja": "お疲れ様です、このみさん。\nどんな感じに……。", "zh": "辛苦了，这位女士。感觉怎么样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "aa46ee43744309d6030b0737bfae9e5101d1518dc2f288a3f1afbeacfdb4e730", "ja": "{$P$}！　やっと来たわね♪\nさあ、とくと見なさい、私のアダルティの集大成を♪", "zh": "{$P$}！你可算来了♪\n来，好好瞧瞧吧，我这集大成的成熟魅力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1003_p", "source_sha256": "09e4660ddd0707be3d74824e5acf721ff3ff043e4f07014fd8243e903a7bc2cc", "ja": "おお！　さすがです！\n最高に大人っぽくて、素晴らしいと思います。", "zh": "哦！不愧是您！成熟魅力十足，我觉得精彩极了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "aefb6ad0b1c9655371a1d9f572cf519bd55dfa51c724bfe9740eeb999c4cb720", "ja": "ふふん、そうよね♪　劇場で一番のお姉さんとしては\nこういうお仕事も、バッチリ決めなくちゃ♪", "zh": "哼哼，确实如此♪ 作为剧场里最成熟的大姐姐，这种工作也必须完美搞定♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1005_p", "source_sha256": "47e24ef52dbb7d4c963c6c5b0c23c27836413f07dc4f5342cd60df5299c838ad", "ja": "はい！　小物の使い方が絶妙ですね。\nシルエットもシュッとしてて、特に……ええと……。", "zh": "好的！您对小道具的运用恰到好处。剪影也显得十分修长，尤其是……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "96e20508a4915dfc26d23e107407b84353a7efd858ba92a7579187113ee6f06c", "ja": "はっきり言っていいわよ。\nいつもより背が高く見えるって言いたいんでしょ？", "zh": "你可以直说的。\n你是想说我看起来比平时高，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8a57411be4d80cb4af15ebe5e2fbb23baaad332d0197452b27974474194a8720", "ja": "すみません、身長のこと、気にしているかなと……。", "zh": "抱歉，我是觉得您可能会在意身高……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "c840a133dbbacc709a35de610d03c2d99333383cc4e27f6cf3644cfc8171f365", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。\n身長の話題は、私の中でも大きな問題だものね。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。\n身高这个话题，对我来说也是个大问题呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "b0ca115267f6c59134cf4afa9bc7fae422f6f79c31746df6e34197c7efdeb66e", "ja": "……{$P$}、\n実はね、最初……このお仕事は断ろうと思ってたの。", "zh": "……{$P$}，\n其实啊，一开始……我是打算拒绝这份工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7b48913912fb571b4e44631edea4e685dc3c9ec087ee7d8acda79aedc9871b76", "ja": "そうだったんですか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "2bae80f1c4700ba8bc8a39e559781c4fb6fe439421c405685120b35a209456b6", "ja": "ええ。だって服を作るとなると……どうしても\n自分の体型に向きあわなくちゃいけないでしょ？", "zh": "是啊。因为一旦要做衣服……就不得不面对自己的身材，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "dd556574ff5a19d5d7c04fd9594107e4a9dab458e1b347d2a66cf8633ac295da", "ja": "開き直ってたつもりだけど、数字で見ちゃうとね。\nだから、あまり気は進まなかったの……。", "zh": "本来是打算看开的，可一看到数字嘛……所以一直不太想面对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8e3bf244b4644c436508aa078c0a02e072b8fbbe42716c90b952ec9a4484f88e", "ja": "このみさん……。", "zh": "木实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "3be92c8463dbfe874bfcf3599ae40e18975cd76627af6bf31dfdc8277e84af7f", "ja": "でも、今の自分と向き合って、こうも思ったの……。", "zh": "可是，在面对现在的自己时，我又这样想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "65feaf1d0de10640e98ca9efbfe369ea03487a82b66d90ec603dc082dc274ea1", "ja": "世の中には、私のように小柄だけど\nアダルティでいたい女の子がいるんじゃないか、って。", "zh": "我想，世上应该也有像我一样身材娇小、却想要走成熟路线的女孩子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1016_p", "source_sha256": "93f2208a27345f3251e94290eaa9a505dbda5cf479e90073ec6f6f62daef32ec", "ja": "……そうですね。理想のスタイルとのギャップに\n悩む女性は多いと聞きます。", "zh": "……确实。我也常听说，有许多女性\n都在为与理想身材之间的差距而烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "442d6f5d8bc9a3bf7c6b68c1c3455fa01b1afb83daa9fffc7fba94590066e41b", "ja": "でしょ？　もし同じような悩みを抱えてる人がいるなら\nこのお仕事をやる意味があるんじゃないのかなって。", "zh": "对吧？如果有着同样烦恼的人存在，那我觉得做这份工作也就有意义了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "f92139807fd71da2b7eca8faa7a83f00fa4007f3e28ff3127f9f82fba7d0cd25", "ja": "だからお仕事、引き受けることにしたの。だって、\n悩める女の子がいるなら、放っておけないじゃない♪", "zh": "所以我才决定接下这个工作。因为要是有女孩子正为烦恼所困，就不能放着她不管嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1019_p", "source_sha256": "537db5b07b9f2c4c53293fae0ed78b70d99cadc824c3ae9f34e283e330a65644", "ja": "ははっ。\nなんだか、このみさんらしくて安心しました。", "zh": "哈哈。总觉得这很像木实姐，让我放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "2d4f979a84cc210f481a209ae2efa95fe9e6da68c7852e72c4c88cee12b7d158", "ja": "そう？　私がそうしてもらったみたいに、この服が\n誰かの背中を押してあげられたらって思っただけよ。", "zh": "是吗？我只是想着，要是这件衣服也能像当初有人帮助我那样，推某个人一把就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "a719884f24860e668f811e11e61a0330c01a103a150047bf78c5ab81110d362b", "ja": "誰かさんのおかげで、私も色々挑戦しなきゃって。\nそう思えるようになったから……ね♪", "zh": "多亏了某个人，我也开始觉得自己应该去挑战各种事情了……能这么想了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0604_1022_p", "source_sha256": "61b4bb58486578ae17b3e98027bf39cd652aa0ee388655b871d3eb067a4319e5", "ja": "（このみさんの優しさと思いが詰まった一着だ。\n多くの人に届くように、俺も宣伝を頑張らないとな！）", "zh": "（这是一件凝聚了这个美小姐的温柔与心意的服装。\n为了让更多人看到，我也得努力宣传才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
